sues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":8,"created_at":"2026-02-07T23:51:09Z","updated_at":"2026-05-25T17:56:43Z","closed_at":"2026-05-25T17:56:43Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproductible in latest commit 56f3e2611daadb0b1894b46737ee3000e82e33f9\n- Reproductible in ccb0b4979935d108d3c6e5b85f96c48556caf377\n- Not reproductible in a0bf14921a2a58115fd9a78b03ef98a2b5f5aee5\n- Not reproductible in 4.6-stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev (56f3e2611) - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9174) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-12900K (24 threads) - 63.78 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nFor some reason that I could not figure out why saving my scene is taking longer since the PR #112426\n\nI was able to \"fix\" the issue by reverting this [single line](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112426/changes#diff-b53bf042051266c5b2d79d86d7a2dd0bad744b2332b8f526a78a55a5978b3a3eR858) in `FileSystemDock::_tree_thumbnail_done` (removing the _apply_thumbnail_filter call) :\n```C\nitem->set_icon(0, _apply_thumbnail_filter(p_small_preview, p_path));\n```\n\n\nBefore the PR :\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/819fa3d6-46e3-4a6b-adb3-43eb727ba1e8)\n\nAfter the PR :\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/449b395f-fe53-404e-a77b-45eeb8585184)\n\nI was able to track the problem the hard way by playing the \"Guess the Number\" game by compiling the engine at some point between 4.6 and latest commit. Around 14 times with a 7 to 10 min compile time. For the next time if you have a better way to do that please send me a link of the correct thing to do, this took me 2 hours.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen the MRP and edit the file by adding an empty line anywhere `res://addons/thing_registry/editor/tree/adapters/adapter_attribute_resource.gd`\nPress Ctrl+S to save the project\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[thing_registry_2026-02-08_00-48-00.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25156596/thing_registry_2026-02-08_00-48-00.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116027/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116027/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}